      ":question/problem": "Express $\\sin\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ and $\\cos x$. Enter both signed coefficients, including zero when needed.\n\n$\\sin\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)=$ {{field-1}} $\\sin x+$ {{field-2}} $\\cos x$",
